  "packageHash": "fhAoDQFVGfWeFQVCdtfYLCsrH9dt0rECbtvRSjZhIuzbZ1owToLA6whGYh/b5zNejHfnD5apl74/Vq11X9vh2A==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 354582,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/art-ix/picturesharp.jxl",
  "published": "2026-10-31T15:56:21.087Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.8: differential testing against libjxl 0.12.0 (cjxl, djxl) of decoding, encoding and JPEG transcoding, and three fixes it found: 8-bit dithering with ApplyExifOrientation is mirrored as in libjxl for orientations that flip the image, FromJpeg rejects JPEGs with DC values beyond +-2047 that it could not reconstruct, and ToJpeg reconstructs cjxl files whose extra zero runs cover more than the rest of a block. Encoded bytes and the pixels of all other decodes are unchanged. No API changes. See docs/releases/release-0.8.8.md and docs/design/0.8.8-differential.md.",
